+
+Machine-checkable test vectors + corporate compliance profiles, run
+against a live cis2-llm server (and, optionally, gateway). See
+conformance/CONFORMANCE.md for how to run this independently and how to
+read the reports. PRIVATE — never published, never referenced from a
+public repo (compliance/CROSSWALK.md rules apply here too).
+"""
